A||||7||Cooter||What do you do about dead-beat bidders on eBay?||||1||
Z||000000||Cooter||12-29-2001||07:25 PM||||I sold a small item a while back and the buyer has not bothered to make payment yet. The auction ended on December 5, he filled out the ebay checkout, but has never sent payment. I have emailed him but have not got any response. What do I need to do?||||reg||1
Z||000001||avengador1||12-29-2001||07:31 PM||||Put your item up for bid again. Notify ebay about the non payment.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by avengador1 (edited 12-29-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Master_Sushi||12-29-2001||07:32 PM||||Same thing just happend to me. I gave him 3 weeks and emaild him twice! He hasen't answered my 2nd email yet. So I just left bad feedback on him.||||reg||1
Z||000003||rogergarrison||12-30-2001||12:10 AM||||I always make sure to include when the contact period is up, then offer it too next higher bid or relist it. With the holidays, its possible some people are away from their puter till next week. That happened to me once, buyer went on vacation.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Fiero_24||12-30-2001||01:14 AM||||Follow this link:<BR> <A HREF="http://pages.ebay.com/help/community/npb.html" TARGET=_blank>http://pages.ebay.com/help/community/npb.html</A> <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/driverside41.jpg"> <BR>  <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24</A> <BR>1987 GT||||reg||6
Z||000005||Bazooka||12-30-2001||09:43 AM||||3 weeks is long enough. SPAM'em and offer the item to the next highest bidder.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Elvira||12-30-2001||08:48 PM||||I also just ran into the same problem.  I got the person's personal info from EBay, called the # and it was disconnected (imagine that) so I left the person negative feedback and am going to relist the item.  You can also file a complaint with EBay and if the person gets 3 complaints against them, they are off EBay indefinitely.  <P>------------------<BR>Elvira<BR>Blue 87GT<BR>Black 86GT 5sp x 2<BR>86SC t-top 58k miles<BR>84 Indy<BR>87 4-seater||||reg||1
Z||000007||Ken Wittlief||12-31-2001||09:03 AM||||I wouldnt leave negative feedback for ANYONE unless the person went out of his way to screw you over<BR> <BR> remember that person gets to leave feedback for you too, so if you trash his feedback he most likely will trash yours too - and no matter what he puts on there you can never get it taken back off, even if its not true.||||reg||10
